    given-names: "Rebson de Morais"
version: "0.8.0-beta.8"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rebsonm/MeuArtigoSkill"
url: "https://github.com/rebsonm/MeuArtigoSkill"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  Meu Artigo is a cross-platform scientific-workflow skill for managing,
  tracing, validating, and documenting AI-assisted article construction.
  It combines C.A.D.A. operational governance, evidence-to-claim
  traceability, journal-aware manuscript construction, adversarial claim
  robustness checks, human validation gates, frozen scientific snapshots,
  AI-use transparency, high-rigor anonymization controls for generated
  external artifacts, and interoperable provenance export.
